<p>Trigger an array of small mirrors to appear all over your cloak.</p><p>The mirrors are positioned to reflect all light shining on you, granting <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>steampower 100">89, 120, 144, 165, 183</acronym> stealth power for 10 turns.</p><p>Stealth power increases with your steampower.</p>